@startuml class-diagram

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam groupInheritance 2

abstract class BaseEntity {
  + id : String
  + createdAt : DateTime
  + updatedAt : DateTime
  + deletedAt : DateTime [0..1]
}

abstract class AuditableEntity {
  + createdBy : User [0..1]
  + updatedBy : User [0..1]
  + deletedBy : User [0..1]
}

class Category {
  + name : String
  + slug : String
}

class Product {
  + name : String
  + slug : String
  + description : String
  + roastLevel : RoastLevel
  + isOrganic : Boolean = false
  + isFairTrade : Boolean = false
  + status : ProductStatus = DRAFT
  + tastingNotes : String [0..1]
  + origin : String
  + processingMethod : String
}

class ProductVariant {
  + sku : String
  + size : Decimal
  + unit : ProductUnit
  + name : String
  + price : Decimal
  + discountType : DiscountType [0..1]
  + discountValue : Decimal [0..1]
  + stockQuantity : Integer = 0
}

class ProductImage {
  + url : String
  + isPrimary : Boolean = false
  + sortOrder : Integer = 0
}

class User {
  + clerkId : String
  + email : String
  + role : UserRole = USER
  + firstName : String
  + lastName : String
  + phoneNumber : String [0..1]
  + avatarUrl : String [0..1]
  + status : UserStatus = ACTIVE
  + address : Address [0..1]
}

class Cart {
  + totalQuantity : Integer
  + subTotal : Decimal
}

class CartItem {
  + quantity : Integer
}

class Order {
  + orderNumber : String
  + status : OrderStatus = PENDING
  + shippingStatus : ShippingStatus = PENDING
  + shippingFee : Decimal
  + shippingMethodName : String
  + tax : Decimal
  + totalAmount : Decimal
  + shippingAddress : Address
  + note : String [0..1]
}

class OrderItem {
  + id : String
  + productName : String
  + productImage : String
  + variantName : String
  + unitPrice : Decimal
  + discountAmount : Decimal
  + quantity : Integer
}

class Payment {
  + method : PaymentMethod
  + status : PaymentStatus = UNPAID
  + transactionId : String [0..1]
  + paidAt : DateTime [0..1]
  + refundedAt : DateTime [0..1]
  + failureReason : String [0..1]
}

class ShippingMethod {
  + name : String
  + description : String
  + price : Decimal
  + status : ShippingMethodStatus = ACTIVE
}

class Address <<dataType>> {
  + firstName : String
  + lastName : String
  + phoneNumber : String
  + addressLine : String
  + city : String
  + district : String
  + ward : String
  + postalCode : String
}

enum RoastLevel <<enumeration>> {
  LIGHT
  MEDIUM
  DARK
}

enum ProductStatus <<enumeration>> {
  DRAFT
  ACTIVE
  INACTIVE
  ARCHIVED
}

enum ProductUnit <<enumeration>> {
  KG
  G
  ML
  L
}

enum DiscountType <<enumeration>> {
  PERCENT
  FIXED
}

enum UserRole <<enumeration>> {
  ADMIN
  USER
}

enum UserStatus <<enumeration>> {
  ACTIVE
  INACTIVE
}

enum OrderStatus <<enumeration>> {
  PENDING
  CONFIRMED
  COMPLETED
  CANCELLED
}

enum ShippingStatus <<enumeration>> {
  PENDING
  SHIPPING
  DELIVERED
  RETURNED
}

enum PaymentStatus <<enumeration>> {
  UNPAID
  PENDING
  PAID
  FAILED
  REFUNDED
}

enum PaymentMethod <<enumeration>> {
  COD
  CARD
  E_WALLET
}

enum ShippingMethodStatus <<enumeration>> {
  ACTIVE
  INACTIVE
}

' ---------------------------------------------------------------
' Rules
' ---------------------------------------------------------------

note bottom of BaseEntity
  deletedAt marks a deleted object:
  no value means not deleted.
end note

note bottom of AuditableEntity
  createdBy, updatedBy and deletedBy are the
  users who made the change; empty when the
  system made it.
end note

note bottom of Category
  name is unique.
end note

note bottom of Product
  name is unique.
  Deleting a product archives it (status
  ARCHIVED): it is no longer shown or sold,
  and it can be set back to ACTIVE later.
  Past orders keep their own copy of the
  names and prices.
end note

note bottom of ProductVariant
  sku is unique.
  discountType and discountValue are both
  set or both empty.
  PERCENT: discountValue from 0 to 100.
  FIXED: discountValue not more than price.
  A variant used by an order is never
  removed, only marked deleted.
end note

note bottom of User
  clerkId and email are unique.
  User is identified by the external
  sign-in provider (clerkId).
  address is saved from the user's first
  checkout and suggested at later checkouts.
  Editing the address at checkout does
  not change it.
end note

note bottom of Cart
  A guest's cart stays on the guest's
  device and is not kept by the shop.
  At sign-in it is merged into the user's
  cart: the same variant adds up its
  quantity, up to the stock. A signed-in
  user always uses the cart the shop keeps.
  Adding to the cart does not reserve
  stock; stock is checked at checkout.
  Placing an order empties the cart.
  totalQuantity = sum of the items'
  quantity; subTotal = sum of each item's
  current price x quantity. Both are
  updated whenever an item changes or a
  variant's price changes.
end note

note bottom of CartItem
  One CartItem per ProductVariant in a cart.
  quantity is at least 1.
end note

note bottom of Order
  orderNumber is unique.
  totalAmount is worked out when the order
  is placed: sum of each item's
  (unitPrice - discountAmount) x quantity
  + shippingFee + tax.
  shippingAddress is a copy of the address
  entered at checkout; shippingFee and
  shippingMethodName are copies of the
  shipping method's price and name.
  They are taken when the
  order is placed, so later changes do not
  change the order.
  The admin moves shippingStatus by hand.
end note

note bottom of OrderItem
  productName and productImage are copied
  from the product, variantName and
  unitPrice from the variant, and
  discountAmount (per unit) is worked out
  from the variant's discount, when the
  order is placed. They never change, so
  OrderItem has no timestamps and does
  not inherit BaseEntity.
end note

note bottom of Payment
  UNPAID: no payment attempt yet.
  PENDING: an online payment is waiting
  for the processor's answer.
  The method can change only while the
  payment is UNPAID or FAILED. A failed
  payment can be retried, with the same
  or another method. failureReason keeps
  why the last attempt failed; it is
  cleared when the payment becomes PAID.
  COD stays UNPAID until the order's
  shippingStatus is DELIVERED, then
  becomes PAID.
  paidAt is set when it becomes PAID.
  Only a PAID payment can become REFUNDED;
  refundedAt is set when it does.
  transactionId is the payment processor's
  reference; COD has none.
end note

note bottom of Address
  A value with no identity, used by
  User.address and Order.shippingAddress.
end note

' ---------------------------------------------------------------
' Relationships
' ---------------------------------------------------------------

' Inheritance: two abstract bases.
BaseEntity <|-- AuditableEntity
BaseEntity <|-- Cart
BaseEntity <|-- CartItem
AuditableEntity <|-- Category
AuditableEntity <|-- Product
AuditableEntity <|-- ProductVariant
AuditableEntity <|-- ProductImage
AuditableEntity <|-- User
AuditableEntity <|-- Order
AuditableEntity <|-- Payment
AuditableEntity <|-- ShippingMethod

' Catalog
Product "0..*" --> "1" Category
note on link
  A category that still has products
  cannot be deleted.
end note

Product "1" *-- "1..*" ProductVariant

Product "1" *-- "2..6" ProductImage
note on link
  Exactly 1 primary image and at least
  1 gallery image, at most 6 in total.
end note

' User and cart
User "1" *-- "0..1" Cart
Cart "1" *-- "0..*" CartItem
CartItem "0..*" --> "1" ProductVariant

' Order
Order "0..*" --> "1" User
Order "1" *-- "1..*" OrderItem
OrderItem "0..*" --> "1" ProductVariant
Order "1" *-- "1" Payment
Order "0..*" --> "1" ShippingMethod

note top of User
  Enums and Address are attribute types,
  so no line is drawn to them.
end note

' Layout only (no meaning): keep the enumerations in rows under the classes.
ProductVariant -[hidden]down- RoastLevel
OrderItem -[hidden]down- UserRole
Payment -[hidden]down- PaymentStatus
RoastLevel -[hidden]right- ProductStatus
ProductStatus -[hidden]right- ProductUnit
ProductUnit -[hidden]right- DiscountType
UserRole -[hidden]right- UserStatus
UserStatus -[hidden]right- OrderStatus
OrderStatus -[hidden]right- ShippingStatus
PaymentStatus -[hidden]right- PaymentMethod
PaymentMethod -[hidden]right- ShippingMethodStatus

@enduml
